#: ../../odin.rst:1
msgid "Documenting Odin"
msgstr "为 Odin 生成文档"

#: ../../odin.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Odin domain gives packages, procedures, types, and members named "
"targets. Guidedog also generates API pages by parsing Odin source. It "
"does not run the compiler or execute the package. A generated signature "
"still needs a useful contract."
msgstr ""
"Odin 域为包、过程、类型和成员提供命名目标。Guidedog 也能解析 Odin 源码生成 API "
"页面，不调用编译器，也不执行包。生成的签名仍需有用的契约。"

#: ../../odin.rst:8
msgid "Describing objects"
msgstr "描述对象"

#: ../../odin.rst:11
msgid "A package is the context of what follows it, as a Python module is:"
msgstr "包为后续内容提供上下文，如同 Python 模块："

#: ../../odin.rst:33
msgid ""
"Signatures are written as Odin writes declarations, on one line, and "
"shown the same way. This is how the ones below look:"
msgstr "签名按 Odin 声明形式写在一行中，显示也相同。以下示例的效果如下："

#: ../../odin.rst:48
msgid "Measures a square."
msgstr "测量一个正方形。"

#: ../../odin.rst:50
msgid "Its side."
msgstr "边长。"

#: ../../odin.rst:51
msgid "Its area."
msgstr "面积。"

#: ../../odin.rst:52
msgid "Whether its kind is known."
msgstr "类型是否已知。"

#: ../../odin.rst:54
msgid "The directives, and the signatures they take:"
msgstr "指令及其接受的签名："

#: ../../odin.rst:56
msgid "``odin:package`` and ``odin:currentpackage``"
msgstr "``odin:package`` 和 ``odin:currentpackage``"

#: ../../odin.rst:57
msgid ""
"``core:fmt``, or a path below a project's roots, such as "
"``readers/sphinx``. The package's import path names its objects: "
"``core:fmt.println``. ``odin:currentpackage`` changes the context without "
"a target. ``None`` clears it. Options: ``:synopsis:``, ``:platform:``, "
"``:deprecated:``, ``:no-index:``, ``:imports:``, and ``:private:``. "
"``:imports:`` lists the import aliases the package's signatures use, as "
"``alias=package`` pairs (``gd=core rst=readers/rst``), so ``gd.Node_Id`` "
"links to ``core.Node_Id``. ``:private:`` lists the package's private "
"types and the private members of its procedure groups (``State Rules "
"catalog_text``). Its signatures show them as text, since they have no "
"descriptions to link to. The generated pages list them automatically."
msgstr ""
"``core:fmt``，或项目根目录下的路径，如 "
"``readers/sphinx``。包的导入路径构成其对象的名称：``core:fmt.println``。``odin:currentpackage`` "
"只切换上下文，不生成目标；``None`` "
"清除上下文。选项有：``:synopsis:``、``:platform:``、``:deprecated:``、``:no-index:``、``:imports:`` "
"和 ``:private:``。``:imports:`` 以 ``alias=package`` "
"对的形式列出包签名中用到的导入别名（``gd=core rst=readers/rst``），这样 ``gd.Node_Id`` 会链接到 "
"``core.Node_Id``。``:private:`` 列出包的私有类型以及过程组的私有成员（``State Rules "
"catalog_text``）。由于它们没有可链接的描述，签名中以纯文本显示。生成的页面会自动列出它们。"

#: ../../odin.rst:68
msgid "``odin:procedure`` (or ``odin:proc``)"
msgstr "``odin:procedure``\\ （或 ``odin:proc``\\ ）"

#: ../../odin.rst:69
msgid ""
"``name :: proc(params) -> results``, with attributes before the name "
"(``@(require_results)``), ``#force_inline`` before ``proc``, a calling "
"convention (``proc \"c\" (...)``), parameters with defaults (``x := 1``, "
"``x: int = 1``), ``$T`` polymorphic parameters, ``..`` variadics, "
"``using``, ``#c_vararg``, named results, tags (``#optional_ok``), and a "
"``where`` clause. ``name(params) -> results`` is short for the same."
msgstr ""
"``name :: proc(params) -> results``\\ ，支持名称前属性（\\ "
"``@(require_results)``\\ ）、\\ ``proc`` 前的 ``#force_inline``\\ 、调用约定（\\ "
"``proc \"c\" (...)``\\ ）、默认参数（\\ ``x := 1``\\ 、\\ ``x: int = 1``\\ ）、\\ "
"``$T`` 多态参数、\\ ``..`` 可变参数、\\ ``using``\\ 、\\ ``#c_vararg``\\ 、命名结果、标签（\\ "
"``#optional_ok``\\ ）和 ``where`` 子句。\\ ``name(params) -> results`` 是简写。"

#: ../../odin.rst:76
msgid "``odin:procgroup``"
msgstr "``odin:procgroup``"

#: ../../odin.rst:77
msgid "``name :: proc{a, b}``: each member links to its procedure."
msgstr "``name :: proc{a, b}``\\ ：每个成员链接到对应过程。"

#: ../../odin.rst:79
msgid ""
"``odin:struct``, ``odin:union``, ``odin:enum``, ``odin:bitset``, "
"``odin:bitfield``, ``odin:type``"
msgstr ""
"``odin:struct``\\ , ``odin:union``\\ , ``odin:enum``\\ , "
"``odin:bitset``\\ , ``odin:bitfield``\\ , ``odin:type``"

#: ../../odin.rst:80
msgid ""
"``Name :: struct($T: typeid) #packed``, ``Name :: union #no_nil {A, B}``, "
"``Name :: enum u8``, ``Name :: bit_set[Flag; u8]``, ``Name :: bit_field "
"u32``, and for ``odin:type``, distinct types and aliases (``Handle :: "
"distinct uintptr``, ``Callback :: proc(x: int) -> bool``). A type's "
"content holds its members."
msgstr ""
"``Name :: struct($T: typeid) #packed``\\ 、\\ ``Name :: union #no_nil {A, "
"B}``\\ 、\\ ``Name :: enum u8``\\ 、\\ ``Name :: bit_set[Flag; u8]``\\ 、\\ "
"``Name :: bit_field u32``\\ 。\\ ``odin:type`` 支持独立类型和别名（\\ ``Handle :: "
"distinct uintptr``\\ 、\\ ``Callback :: proc(x: int) -> bool``\\ "
"）。类型内容包含其成员。"

#: ../../odin.rst:85
msgid "``odin:field`` and ``odin:enumerator``"
msgstr "``odin:field`` 和 ``odin:enumerator``"

#: ../../odin.rst:86
msgid ""
"Inside a type: ``name: Type`` with a tag (``name: string `json:\"n\"```) "
"or a bit size (``low: u8 | 3``), and ``Name`` or ``Name = 3``. Their "
"names are ``Type.member``."
msgstr ""
"类型内部使用 ``name: Type``\\ ，可带标签（\\ ``name: string `json:\"n\"```\\ ）或位宽（\\ "
"``low: u8 | 3``\\ ）；枚举成员使用 ``Name`` 或 ``Name = 3``\\ 。其名称为 "
"``Type.member``\\ 。"

#: ../../odin.rst:90
msgid "``odin:const``, ``odin:var``, ``odin:foreign``"
msgstr "``odin:const``\\ , ``odin:var``\\ , ``odin:foreign``"

#: ../../odin.rst:91
msgid ""
"``NAME :: 64`` or ``NAME : int : 64``; ``name: Type``, ``name := value``, "
"or ``name: Type = value``; ``libc \"system:c\"`` for a foreign import."
msgstr ""
"``NAME :: 64`` 或 ``NAME : int : 64``\\ ；\\ ``name: Type``\\ 、\\ ``name := "
"value`` 或 ``name: Type = value``\\ ；外部导入使用 ``libc \"system:c\"``\\ 。"

#: ../../odin.rst:94
msgid ""
"Every object takes the options objects take in Sphinx's domains: "
"``:no-index:``, ``:no-index-entry:``, ``:no-contents-entry:``, and "
"``:no-typesetting:``. It also takes these of its own: ``:package:`` "
"(describe it in another package), ``:private:`` and ``:deprecated: "
"message`` (shown as ``@(private)`` and ``@(deprecated=\"message\")`` "
"unless the signature has them), ``:availability: Windows, Linux`` (a "
"first line of the content saying where it exists), and ``:foreign: libc`` "
"(a procedure of a foreign block). A directive with several signature "
"lines describes one object whose signature differs between targets. Only "
"the first line gets the id and the index entry."
msgstr ""
"每个对象都支持 Sphinx "
"域中对象的选项：``:no-index:``、``:no-index-entry:``、``:no-contents-entry:`` 和 "
"``:no-typesetting:``。此外还有自己的选项：``:package:`` （在另一个包中描述它）、``:private:`` 和 "
"``:deprecated: message`` （签名中没有时显示为 ``@(private)`` 和 "
"``@(deprecated=\"message\")``）、``:availability: Windows, Linux`` "
"（在内容首行说明它在哪些平台上存在），以及 ``:foreign: libc`` （foreign "
"块中的过程）。带多行签名的指令描述的是同一个对象，只是在不同目标平台上签名不同。只有第一行获得 ID 和索引条目。"

#: ../../odin.rst:103
msgid ""
"Names in type positions link to the types they name. They are looked up "
"first in the package and type the signature is written in, then as "
"written. Built-in types (``int``, ``string``, ``rawptr``, ``typeid``, "
"``any``, ...), keywords, polymorphic names (``$T``, and ``T`` after it, "
"in the signature or in the type the object is nested in), array lengths, "
"default values, constants, tags, and ``where`` clauses are shown as "
"written, never as links."
msgstr ""
"类型位置上的名称会链接到它所指的类型。查找时先在签名所在的包和类型中找，再按原样查找。内置类型（``int``、``string``、``rawptr``、``typeid``、``any`` "
"等）、关键字、多态名称（签名或外层类型中的 ``$T`` 及其后的 ``T``）、数组长度、默认值、常量、标签和 ``where`` "
"子句都原样显示，绝不生成链接。"

#: ../../odin.rst:110
msgid "Roles and ids"
msgstr "角色与标识符"

#: ../../odin.rst:113
msgid ""
"``:odin:pkg:``, ``:odin:proc:``, ``:odin:type:`` (structs, unions, enums, "
"bit sets, bit fields, and other types), ``:odin:const:``, ``:odin:var:``, "
"``:odin:field:``, ``:odin:enumerator:``, and ``:odin:obj:`` (any of them) "
"link to objects. As in the Python domain, ``~`` shows only the last part "
"(``:odin:proc:`~core:fmt.println``` shows ``println``), and a leading "
"``.`` finds the name at the end of any object's name. A name is looked up "
"in the reference's type and package first, then as written, then after a "
"package path's ``:`` or ``/``. So ``fmt.println`` finds "
"``core:fmt.println``, and ``sphinx.Config`` finds "
"``readers/sphinx.Config``, as Odin code names a package by its last "
"segment. An import alias the current package declares with ``:imports:`` "
"is followed first. With ``default-domain:: odin`` (or ``primary_domain = "
"\"odin\"``), the roles need no ``odin:``."
msgstr ""
"``:odin:pkg:``、``:odin:proc:``、``:odin:type:`` "
"（结构体、联合体、枚举、位集合、位字段及其他类型）、``:odin:const:``、``:odin:var:``、``:odin:field:``、``:odin:enumerator:`` "
"和 ``:odin:obj:`` （以上任意一种）用于链接对象。与 Python 域一样，``~`` "
"只显示最后一段（``:odin:proc:`~core:fmt.println``` 显示为 ``println``），开头的 ``.`` "
"会在任意对象名称的末尾查找该名称。查找顺序是：先在引用所在的类型和包中，然后按原样，再去掉包路径中 ``:`` 或 ``/`` 之前的部分。所以 "
"``fmt.println`` 能找到 ``core:fmt.println``，``sphinx.Config`` 能找到 "
"``readers/sphinx.Config``，这与 Odin 代码用最后一段称呼包的方式一致。当前包用 ``:imports:`` "
"声明的导入别名优先解析。使用 ``default-domain:: odin`` （或 ``primary_domain = "
"\"odin\"``）时，角色无需写 ``odin:``。"

#: ../../odin.rst:125
msgid ""
"An object's id is Sphinx's ``make_id`` of ``odin-`` and its full name: "
"``odin-core-fmt.println``, ``odin-readers-sphinx.Config.docname``. Case "
"and dots are kept, as Sphinx keeps them for Python ids. The ``:`` and "
"``/`` of the import path become hyphens. Ids are therefore readable in "
"URLs, the same in every build, and distinct for two packages with the "
"same last name. A package's id is ``odin-package-`` and its path. Index "
"entries read \"println (procedure in core:fmt)\". ``objects.inv`` lists "
"every object with the domain ``odin`` and its type (``odin:procedure``, "
"``odin:struct``, ``odin:field``, ...), packages first, as Sphinx lists "
"modules."
msgstr ""
"对象的 ID 是 Sphinx 的 ``make_id`` 作用于 ``odin-`` "
"加全名的结果：``odin-core-fmt.println``、``odin-readers-sphinx.Config.docname``。大小写和点都保留，与 "
"Sphinx 处理 Python ID 的方式相同。导入路径中的 ``:`` 和 ``/`` 变为连字符。因此，ID 在 URL "
"中易读、每次构建都相同，而且最后一段同名的两个包也能区分。包的 ID 是 ``odin-package-`` "
"加其路径。索引条目形如“println (procedure in core:fmt)”。``objects.inv`` 以 ``odin`` "
"域及类型（``odin:procedure``、``odin:struct``、``odin:field`` 等）列出所有对象，包排在最前，就像 "
"Sphinx 列出模块一样。"

#: ../../odin.rst:134
msgid ""
"Info fields in the content are grouped as in the other domains: ``:param "
"name:`` (with ``:type name:``), ``:result name:`` for a named result, "
"``:returns:``, and ``:rtype:``."
msgstr ""
"内容中的信息字段与其他域一样分组：\\ ``:param name:``\\ （配合 ``:type name:``\\ ）、命名结果的 "
"``:result name:``\\ 、\\ ``:returns:`` 和 ``:rtype:``\\ 。"

#: ../../odin.rst:137
msgid "Generating from source"
msgstr "从源码生成"

#: ../../odin.rst:140
msgid ""
"We tell Guidedog where our packages are, relative to the source folder:"
msgstr "我们告诉 Guidedog 包的位置（相对于源目录）："

#: ../../odin.rst:147
msgid ""
"A package below ``odin_autoapi_dirs`` is named by its path there "
"(``src/shapes/round`` is ``shapes/round``). A package in a collection is "
"named as Odin imports it (``core:strings``). The generating directives "
"then work as autodoc's do:"
msgstr ""
"位于 ``odin_autoapi_dirs`` 下的包以其相对路径命名（``src/shapes/round`` 即 "
"``shapes/round``）。集合中的包按 Odin 导入它的方式命名（``core:strings``）。之后，生成类指令的用法与 "
"autodoc 相同："

#: ../../odin.rst:161
msgid ""
"``odin:autopackage`` writes the package, its doc comment, and with "
"``:members:`` its declarations (all of them, or those listed). "
"``odin:autoproc``, ``odin:autoprocgroup``, ``odin:autotype``, "
"``odin:autoconst``, and ``odin:autovar`` write one declaration, named in "
"the current package or as ``package.name``. Options: ``:members:``, "
"``:undoc-members:``, ``:private-members:`` (``@(private)`` declarations, "
"which are left out otherwise), ``:exclude-members:``, ``:member-order:``, "
"and ``:no-index:``. ``:member-order:`` is ``source`` (the default, by "
"file name and then position), ``alphabetical``, or ``groupwise``. "
"``groupwise`` heads the groups \"Types\", \"Procedures\", \"Procedure "
"groups\", \"Constants\", \"Variables\", and \"Foreign imports\"."
msgstr ""
"``odin:autopackage`` 输出包及其文档注释，加上 ``:members:`` "
"时还输出其中的声明（全部或列出的那些）。``odin:autoproc``、``odin:autoprocgroup``、``odin:autotype``、``odin:autoconst`` "
"和 ``odin:autovar`` 各输出一个声明，名称写当前包中的名称或 "
"``package.name``。选项有：``:members:``、``:undoc-members:``、``:private-members:`` "
"（``@(private)`` 声明，默认不输出）、``:exclude-members:``、``:member-order:`` 和 "
"``:no-index:``。``:member-order:`` 可取 ``source`` "
"（默认，先按文件名再按位置）、``alphabetical`` 或 ``groupwise``。``groupwise`` "
"分组的标题为“Types”“Procedures”“Procedure "
"groups”“Constants”“Variables”和“Foreign imports”。"

#: ../../odin.rst:172
msgid ""
"Doc comments are the ``//`` lines directly above a declaration, or a ``/* "
"*/`` block there, and a field's or enumerator's comment at the end of its "
"line. They are plain text, and become reStructuredText as follows:"
msgstr ""
"文档注释是声明正上方的 ``//`` 行或 ``/* */`` 块，以及字段或枚举成员的行尾注释。它们是纯文本，按以下规则转为 "
"reStructuredText："

#: ../../odin.rst:176
msgid "Paragraphs stay paragraphs. A list of ``- item`` lines stays a list."
msgstr "段落仍然是段落。由 ``- item`` 行组成的列表仍然是列表。"

#: ../../odin.rst:177
msgid ""
"An indented block (a tab or spaces) after a blank line, or after a line "
"ending in a colon (``Example:``), is a ``code-block:: odin``, or ``text`` "
"after ``Output:``. A line indented more than the text directly after a "
"paragraph line continues it."
msgstr ""
"空行之后，或以冒号结尾的行（\\ ``Example:``\\ ）之后，缩进块（制表符或空格）转为 ``code-block:: odin``\\ "
"；\\ ``Output:`` 后转为 ``text``\\ 。若某行比紧接段落行的文本缩进更深，则续接该段落。"

#: ../../odin.rst:180
msgid ""
"``Inputs:`` followed by ``- name: text`` items become ``:param name:`` "
"fields, and ``Returns:`` items ``:result name:`` fields (or ``:returns:`` "
"when they have no names), as Odin's core library writes them."
msgstr ""
"``Inputs:`` 后的 ``- name: text`` 列表转为 ``:param name:`` 字段；\\ ``Returns:`` "
"条目转为 ``:result name:``\\ ，无名称则转为 ``:returns:``\\ 。这与 Odin 核心库的注释形式一致。"

#: ../../odin.rst:183
msgid "A line starting ``NOTE:`` or ``WARNING:`` is a note or a warning."
msgstr "以 ``NOTE:`` 或 ``WARNING:`` 开头的行成为注释或警告。"

#: ../../odin.rst:184
msgid ""
"```code``` is literal text. Every other character reStructuredText would "
"read as markup (``*``, ``|``, a ``_`` ending a word, ...) is escaped, so "
"the comment reads as written and never warns."
msgstr ""
"```code``` 是字面文本。其他会被 reStructuredText 解释为标记的字符（\\ ``*``\\ 、\\ ``|``\\ "
"、词尾 ``_`` 等）都进行转义，因此注释按原样显示，不产生警告。"

#: ../../odin.rst:188
msgid "API pages"
msgstr "API 页面"

#: ../../odin.rst:191
msgid ""
"With ``odin_autoapi_dirs`` set, every package below those folders also "
"gets a page of its own. The build generates it as it reads it, like "
"sphinx-autoapi does. ``api/shapes`` holds ``odin:autopackage:: shapes`` "
"with ``odin_autoapi_options``. ``api/index`` lists every package with its "
"synopsis. The pages are documents of the project (in the toctree, search, "
"the general index, ``singlehtml``, and the PDF book). They are never "
"written into the source folder. Settings:"
msgstr ""
"设置 ``odin_autoapi_dirs`` 后，这些目录下的每个包还会各自获得一个页面。构建在读取时生成这些页面，就像 "
"sphinx-autoapi 那样。``api/shapes`` 包含带 ``odin_autoapi_options`` 的 "
"``odin:autopackage:: shapes``。``api/index`` 列出每个包及其简介。这些页面是项目的文档（会进入 "
"toctree、搜索、总索引、``singlehtml`` 和 PDF 书籍），但绝不会写入源目录。设置项如下："

#: ../../odin.rst:198
msgid "``odin_autoapi_dirs``"
msgstr "``odin_autoapi_dirs``"

#: ../../odin.rst:199
msgid ""
"The folders whose packages get pages, relative to the source folder. Only "
"files below them (and below ``odin_collections``) are read, and a link "
"leading elsewhere is refused."
msgstr "需要生成页面的包目录，相对于源目录。只读取这些目录及 ``odin_collections`` 内的文件；指向外部的链接会被拒绝。"

#: ../../odin.rst:203
msgid "``odin_collections``"
msgstr "``odin_collections``"

#: ../../odin.rst:204
msgid ""
"A table of collection names and folders, for directive arguments such as "
"``core:strings``. These packages get no pages."
msgstr "集合名称与目录的对照表，供 ``core:strings`` 这类指令参数使用。这些包不生成页面。"

#: ../../odin.rst:207
msgid "``odin_autoapi_root``"
msgstr "``odin_autoapi_root``"

#: ../../odin.rst:208
msgid ""
"The folder of the pages, ``\"api\"`` by default. A document of the source "
"folder with a page's name keeps its name, with a warning."
msgstr "页面目录，默认 ``\"api\"``\\ 。若源文档已占用某页面名称，则保留源文档并发出警告。"

#: ../../odin.rst:211
msgid "``odin_autoapi_options``"
msgstr "``odin_autoapi_options``"

#: ../../odin.rst:212
msgid ""
"``[\"members\", \"undoc-members\"]`` by default. ``private-members`` may "
"be added."
msgstr "默认为 ``[\"members\", \"undoc-members\"]``。可以加上 ``private-members``。"

#: ../../odin.rst:214
msgid "``odin_autoapi_member_order``"
msgstr "``odin_autoapi_member_order``"

#: ../../odin.rst:215
msgid ""
"``\"source\"`` (default), ``\"alphabetical\"``, or ``\"groupwise\"``."
msgstr ""
"``\"source\"``\\ （默认）、\\ ``\"alphabetical\"`` 或 ``\"groupwise\"``\\ 。"

#: ../../odin.rst:217
msgid "``odin_autoapi_add_toctree_entry``"
msgstr "``odin_autoapi_add_toctree_entry``"

#: ../../odin.rst:218
msgid ""
"``true`` (default): ``api/index`` joins the root document's first toctree."
msgstr "``true``\\ （默认）：\\ ``api/index`` 加入根文档的第一个 toctree。"

#: ../../odin.rst:220
msgid "``odin_autoapi_generate_api_docs``"
msgstr "``odin_autoapi_generate_api_docs``"

#: ../../odin.rst:221
msgid ""
"``true`` (default). ``false`` reads the folders for the directives only."
msgstr "``true`` （默认）。设为 ``false`` 时，只为指令读取这些目录。"

#: ../../odin.rst:223
msgid ""
"Types from packages we do not document (``core:io.Writer``) cannot be "
"linked. With ``-n``, we silence them with ``nitpick_ignore_regex = "
"[[\"odin:type\", \"(core|base):.*\"]]``. Guidedog's own API reference, "
"``docs/api``, is now built the same way from Rust source with "
"``rust_autoapi_crates``. See :doc:`rust`."
msgstr ""
"我们不记录的包中的类型（如 ``core:io.Writer``）无法链接。使用 ``-n`` 时，可以用 "
"``nitpick_ignore_regex = [[\"odin:type\", \"(core|base):.*\"]]`` "
"屏蔽这类警告。Guidedog 自己的 API 参考 ``docs/api`` 现在以同样的方式，通过 "
"``rust_autoapi_crates`` 从 Rust 源码构建。见 :doc:`rust`。"

#: ../../odin.rst:228
msgid "Platforms"
msgstr "平台"

#: ../../odin.rst:231
msgid ""
"A package is documented once for every target Odin builds, as Odin itself "
"sees its files. A file named ``*_windows.odin``, ``*_linux_arm64.odin``, "
"or ``*_amd64.odin`` builds only for those targets. ``#+build linux, "
"darwin`` and ``#+build !windows`` tags (and the older ``//+build``) "
"narrow it. A file-scope ``when ODIN_OS == .Windows`` block counts for its "
"targets (and its ``else`` for the others) when its condition only "
"compares ``ODIN_OS`` and ``ODIN_ARCH``. Files named ``*_test.odin``, and "
"files tagged ``#+ignore``, are left out. A declaration made for every "
"target the package builds for is shown once. One made for some targets "
"says which, \"Availability: Windows\". One whose signature differs "
"between targets is shown once per signature, each with its targets, the "
"first with the id. A package that builds only for some targets says so "
"with its ``:platform:``."
msgstr ""
"包会针对 Odin 能构建的每个目标各记录一次，判断方式与 Odin 看待自身文件的方式相同。名为 "
"``*_windows.odin``、``*_linux_arm64.odin`` 或 ``*_amd64.odin`` "
"的文件只为相应目标构建。``#+build linux, darwin`` 和 ``#+build !windows`` 标签（以及旧式的 "
"``//+build``）会进一步缩小范围。文件作用域的 ``when ODIN_OS == .Windows`` 块，如果条件只比较 "
"``ODIN_OS`` 和 ``ODIN_ARCH``，就归入相应目标（其 ``else`` 归入其余目标）。名为 ``*_test.odin`` "
"的文件和带 ``#+ignore`` "
"标签的文件会被排除。对包的所有构建目标都存在的声明只显示一次。只在部分目标上存在的声明会注明是哪些目标，如“Availability: "
"Windows”。签名因目标而异的声明按每种签名各显示一次，并分别注明目标，只有第一种带 ID。只能为部分目标构建的包，用其 "
"``:platform:`` 注明。"

#: ../../odin.rst:243
msgid "Rebuilding"
msgstr "重新构建"

#: ../../odin.rst:246
msgid ""
"Every Odin file a page read is a dependency of that page. When we edit a "
"package's source, the next build reads again only the pages that document "
"it. The package index is read again when a package appears, disappears, "
"or changes its synopsis. ``guidedog serve`` checks modification times in "
"``odin_autoapi_dirs`` and ``odin_collections`` before serving an HTML "
"page. We refresh the browser after editing."
msgstr ""
"页面读取的每个 Odin "
"文件都是该页面的依赖。修改某个包的源码后，下次构建只会重新读取记录该包的页面。有包新增、消失或简介变化时，会重新读取包索引。``guidedog "
"serve`` 在返回 HTML 页面之前，会检查 ``odin_autoapi_dirs`` 和 ``odin_collections`` "
"中文件的修改时间。编辑后刷新浏览器即可。"

#: ../../odin.rst:252
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../../odin.rst:255
msgid ""
"The source is parsed, never compiled or type-checked. Types are shown as "
"written, a constant's value as written (and left out beyond 100 "
"characters), and nothing is inferred. Whether ``A :: B`` declares a type "
"or a constant is told from the names: a capitalized name not in capitals "
"throughout, or a built-in type, is a type."
msgstr ""
"源码只做解析，从不编译或做类型检查。类型按原样显示，常量的值也按原样显示（超过 100 个字符时省略），不做任何推断。``A :: B`` "
"声明的是类型还是常量，根据名称判断：首字母大写但不是全大写的名称，或内置类型，视为类型。"

#: ../../odin.rst:259
msgid ""
"Conditions of ``when`` blocks other than comparisons of ``ODIN_OS`` and "
"``ODIN_ARCH`` are not evaluated: both branches are documented."
msgstr "``when`` 中除 ``ODIN_OS`` 和 ``ODIN_ARCH`` 比较之外的条件不求值，两分支都会记录。"

#: ../../odin.rst:261
msgid ""
"A declaration that mentions a private type shows it as text, since "
"private declarations have no entries unless ``:private-members:`` is "
"given. The generated package lists them in ``:private:``, so ``-n`` has "
"nothing to report."
msgstr ""
"声明中提到的私有类型显示为文本，因为除非指定 ``:private-members:``，私有声明不会有条目。生成的包会在 "
"``:private:`` 中列出它们，所以 ``-n`` 不会报告任何问题。"

#: ../../odin.rst:264
msgid ""
"Guidedog reads declarations with its own port of Odin's tokenizer and "
"parser. The parser skips procedure bodies. A syntax error in a "
"declaration is reported (``odin.autodoc.syntax``), and what could be read "
"is still documented."
msgstr ""
"Guidedog 用自己移植的 Odin "
"词法分析器和解析器读取声明。解析器会跳过过程体。声明中的语法错误会被报告（``odin.autodoc.syntax``），能读取的部分仍然照常记录。"

#: ../../odin.rst:267
msgid ""
"A declaration nested deeper than 160 levels of brackets or types is far "
"deeper than real code. Its file is left out with the warning "
"``odin.autodoc.nesting``, and the rest of its package is documented. Long "
"flat chains (``a + b + ...``) and anything inside procedure bodies do not "
"count. A ``when`` condition is evaluated to 64 levels of ``&&``, ``||`` "
"and ``!``. A longer one counts as not evaluated."
msgstr ""
"嵌套超过 160 层括号或类型的声明，远远超出实际代码的深度。这样的文件会被排除并给出 ``odin.autodoc.nesting`` "
"警告，包中其余内容照常记录。长而扁平的链（``a + b + ...``）以及过程体内的任何内容都不计入深度。``when`` 条件最多求值到 "
"64 层 ``&&``、``||`` 和 ``!``，更长的条件视为未求值。"

#: ../../odin.rst:272
msgid ""
"A file larger than the per-file limit is left out with "
"``odin.autodoc.memory``."
msgstr "超过单文件限制的文件会被排除，并给出 ``odin.autodoc.memory`` 警告。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "``core:odin/parser`` refuses a procedure with both ``#optional_ok`` "
#~ "and a ``where`` clause; such a file is reported, and what could be "
#~ "read is still documented."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "``core:odin/parser`` 拒绝同时带 ``#optional_ok`` 和 ``where`` "
#~ "子句的过程。此类文件会被报告，能读取的部分仍生成文档。"
